WEBVTT

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.090
What do you think?
Were you able to determine the cause?

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.840
No, something's wrong here.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.760
There's no evidence here
that would cause it to activate.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.730
You sure it's okay? I mean,
they're military weapons, right?

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.140
There's no worry.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:27.600
When we return, we'll ask Douji to check them.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:15.130
"Chaos"

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.840
They say the X-Cons are on the run.
"Chaos"

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:17.920
"Chaos"

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.470
What the hell's Douji Industries doing?!
"Chaos"

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:20.550
"Chaos"

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:24.220
No, it's much better than them saying,
"It's all up to you, cops!"

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.100
All we hafta do now is
give good logistical support.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.230
Seems the government's going to
make Douji take full responsibility.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:39.360
I have to get home... Riko is waiting...

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.870
H-Hey! Isn't that an X-Con?!

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.700
It doesn't look like one.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.120
No, it definitely is! Contact them!

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:52.880
This is Ginza 303!
An X-Con has appeared on Central Street!

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:53.920
Stop!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:56.880
I have to get back...

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:02.050
Stop right there, X-Con!

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:07.680
What are you

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:31.290
Disappear, but be by your side, huh...

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.120
I'm sure she tried really
hard coming up with that.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:42.880
Telling you was hard for her, too.
But she had to tell you.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.930
You understand why, right?

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:52.100
So I won't feel lonely...

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.440
Yeah.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:57.400
And so that you can smile sooner.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.870
It's tough, though...

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.370
"X-Con Recovery Fails!!"

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.120
It appears Douji Industries
has failed to destroy the X-Con

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:17.960
Hold on, now! What's going on?!
I can't sleep soundly now!

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.880
That company is done for.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.420
It was always done for.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:25.130
There are reports that the fleeing
X-Con destroyed a police car,

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.010
but its current location is unknown.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:32.180
I told you to send more! You failed again!

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:37.520
Shouting won't solve anything.
The Witchblade's power is increasing.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:42.070
Assuming it was the Witchblade
that created Naru Point six years ago,

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.780
then this isn't even a
fraction of its true energy.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:48.950
I don't need your explanations!
Figure out what to do next!

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:53.120
We can't take on an enemy
of this magnitude so effortlessly.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.120
Plus a certain someone won't stop bothering me.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.370
Why, you !

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.420
Don't call back for a while.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.430
It truly is magnificent...

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:10.100
Damn that woman!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:13.810
Does she even understand the situation?!

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:18.480
Sir, everyone is waiting in the boardroom.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.810
You have a status report
and a press conference to

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.980
I know! I'm thinking about it right now!

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:27.200
Yes. I don't believe thinking
will change the facts, sir...

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.780
Quiet!

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.660
How lowly...

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:44.840
You'd better be all right, Masane...

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:55.560
I-I-It's here!

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:01.020
Run for it!

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.770
W-We have to save Rihoko-Chan!

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.200
R-Rihoko-Chan!

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.280
What's going on?!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.740
A monster is attacking!

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.830
Monster?

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.700
It's downstairs! Let's escape out the back!

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:26.210
Begone, evil spirit!
Are there any blunt objects?!

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.260
Help!

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.970
Masamune...

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.970
Ri... ko...

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.730
Rihoko! What are you

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.270
It's alright!

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.790
Welcome home, Mom.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.170
Mom? Mom?! Mom!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:14.720
Mom! Say something! Mom!
Masamune! Masamune! Hey!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.810
No way... Masamune-Chan?

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:28.570
Asagi-san! Please hurry!

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.990
I'm tired...

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:37.830
The Witchblade's presence
has weakened a little bit.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.290
Even so, I can easily tell where it is.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.000
What immense power...

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:49.880
Just thinking about you having it is wonderful!

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.170
Yes...

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.860
I know! Something to eat...

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:15.070
So that you can smile sooner.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.130
That can't be!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:31.840
Our Masamune-Chan had that happen to her?!

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.760
That... can't be...

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:44.020
Quit cryin'.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.270
But...

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.400
Quit crying!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:55.700
He's right. Crying won't help anything.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.130
Say what...

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.140
What's wrong?

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.350
The I-Weapons...

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.940
They broke out of the ship
headed for Baradhi...

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.520
Huh?

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:32.320
The I-Weapons have
started to move on their own!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.820
They're all heading for Tokyo!

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.820
What am I going to do?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:43.080
If the I-Weapons really do enter Tokyo...

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:46.330
This is bad! This is far
worse than the X-Con fuss!

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:50.130
I guess this was the malfunction
the lab was talking about.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.710
You! Do something!
Do something to stop the I-Weapons!

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.970
I can't do that.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.850
Then... Then...

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.430
Y-Yes!

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:08.100
Call Takayama!
He's the one in charge of the I-Weapons!

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:09.980
Call Takayama-san?

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.520
He might be able to do something!
Get him here at once!

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:16.280
I'll even promise to reinstate him at Douji!

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:20.610
Okay... But I don't know where he is...

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:21.490
Oh?

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.870
Come to think of it, there's been
no word from the lab since then...

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:25.950
Could it be that

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.080
Just call him now!

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.120
At this rate, both Douji and I are ruined!

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:36.050
I don't think this is
that level of a problem...

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:39.920
Mom?!

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.270
Riko...

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:53.060
Are you all right? I'm making dinner now!
It's all stuff you... love.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.780
I'm home...

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.910
I hadn't said it yet.

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.000
The pan is going to burn!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:47.660
Sir! The post-processing is nearly complete!

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.910
We can completely protect against
the Witchblade's interference!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:51.910
Good work.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.670
Truly impressive! So it was you
who stopped the I-Weapons, sir!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:57.880
Segawa...

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:08.350
Oh, it's all right. He's here to see you, sir.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.970
Hi there, Takayama-kun...

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.270
The I-Weapons on the transport ship?!

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:17.110
See! We told you to stop the shipment!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:21.570
How could you ignore the lab?!
This is the worst possible outcome!

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:25.030
Shut up! That doesn't matter now!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.240
Takayama! Surely you can do something...

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.740
How many I-Weapons?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.500
3800.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:35.960
Impossible! We can't stop that!

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:39.000
Impossible or not,
Douji is done for if we don't!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.920
That's far too many to handle.

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:49.140
Inform our government contacts,
and have them evacuate the coasts!

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:52.100
Don't be absurd! Then there
was no point in me coming here!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:55.600
Find a way to end this without going public!

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:59.150
Takayama! If you can pull this off,
I'll get your job at Douji

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:03.690
We're strapped for time!
Segawa, can you do what I just said?

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.400
Yes, if I use Wadou-san's name.

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:08.740
Hurry!
Yes, sir!

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:12.830
Segawa! Don't tell me you've been
a spy for Takayama all this time!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.790
No. I only switched sides just now.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.250
That's how he is.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:23.000
Takayama! Remember the old days!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:26.760
What do you say we row a boat again,
like in our old college days?!

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.930
The boat known as Douji!

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:31.300
The boat has already sunk.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:36.480
Wadou-san, you put the holes in it.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:49.740
Ota! Locate the I-Weapons'
signals and estimate their course!

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:51.620
We're sending out our I-Weapons here!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.120
Everyone, get things ready!

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.160
Yes, sir!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.290
The evacuation orders will be given right away.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.290
Excellent.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.670
You've changed somewhat, sir.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.010
How do you mean?

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.300
Before, wouldn't you have stuck to your guns...

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:11.180
...and looked for a way to save Douji?

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:14.260
It's only natural to try to minimize damage.

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:16.140
Well, yes, but...

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:28.440
3800 I-Weapons...

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:37.160
Hello?

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.080
I finally got through!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.580
Sorry, I'm

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:41.790
Just listen!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.130
I-Weapons?!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:51.800
Yes. All 3800 units are headed for Tokyo.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:55.010
You mean... they're headed for me.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.770
Yes.

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:05.770
It's alright. My body may be broken,
but I can sense the power.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:08.940
It's getting bigger and bigger inside me.

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:11.820
Enough to tear me apart at any time.

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:15.830
Be careful. We don't know the
extent of the Witchblade's power.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:16.700
Yeah.

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:20.790
And avoid fighting in open
areas whenever possible.

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.830
These types are good on level ground,
but not at moving up or down.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.590
Got it.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:30.090
I'm going to use the lab's I-Weapons
to take out as many as possible.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:34.140
Roger that. Any other instructions, boss?

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:37.760
That is all!

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:40.770
Then I have one thing to tell you...

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:43.690
When Rihoko talks in her sleep,

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:46.440
she's just like you when you're drunk.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:48.230
See it sometime.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.820
Okay.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.900
Later.

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.610
Yeah.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.250
Hey.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:14.180
A newsflash just now...

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.760
...said tons of I-Weapons
are headed this way...

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:20.260
Yeah. Takayama just contacted me about it.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:21.930
Don't tell me you're gonna...

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:22.850
Yeah.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.560
But...!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:25.770
Mom!

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:33.610
Oh! It's ready! Awesome!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.990
There's still more!

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.120
Your homemade food is the greatest, Riko!

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.970
What is it?

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.560
What is the I-Weapons' current location?

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:09.060
8.4 kilometers off the coast.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:12.030
And they're splitting up here.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:15.950
At present, there are five landing points.
Shall we split ours up, too?

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:19.910
No, there's no point in splitting
up a little under 300 units.

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.370
We'll concentrate on one
point and strike head-on!

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.080
Understood!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:28.170
Permission to mobilize I-Weapons?
We haven't received it, naturally.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:29.830
Because we never requested it.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.340
Yes. It's all Director Wadou's orders.

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:39.550
He also says he'll take
responsibility. Goodbye.

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:44.770
Looks like I'll have to find new employment...

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:46.770
This is the Metro Police.

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:49.400
Evacuation orders have
been issued for this area.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:52.020
Please evacuate toward Ueno immediately!

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:58.570
This is serious!
Where are Rihoko-Chan and the others?

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.160
Tozawa-san should be with them...

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.870
There's no reason to freak out.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:08.290
She's eating Rihoko's food right now...

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:09.960
Oh...

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:13.210
That's good. There's no need to rush.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:19.510
What's wrong?!

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.140
It's Masamune...

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:28.600
She's... lost all sense of taste...

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:34.070
Yes, it's delicious!
Your cooking's the best, Riko!

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.820
I tried using different seasoning than usual!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:40.700
It's great! You're a cooking genius!

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:03.850
Here they come...

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:09.640
The I-Weapons. Some seem
to be heading this way, too...

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:13.730
They're not just drawn to
the Witchblade, but to us, too.

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:15.150
So?

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:18.400
We eradicate everything that gets in our way.

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:19.940
Everything...

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:21.900
"Bank Account Book
Amaha Rihoko"

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.000
Everything I own.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:33.620
I made it so you can use it whenever
you want, so don't lose it now!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:39.420
Let's see. And there's this
it has Takayama-san's number on it.

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:41.800
I'm sure he'll come to your rescue!

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.840
Okay! Got it!

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:45.300
Excellent!

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.140
Here you go!

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.940
Riko...

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.150
Mom...

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:09.330
I'm sorry for making you wait!
Please take good care of Rihoko.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.250
Masamune-Chan!

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:15.500
Don't you worry, Masamune-Chan!
Come here, Rihoko-Chan!

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:33.390
Come back, now! I still haven't
gotten this month's rent, you know!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:34.850
Yeah!

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:40.570
Masane-san! Great luck! You have great luck!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.240
Thanks, Naomi-Chan!

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.700
Mom!

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:51.740
See you later!

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.870
I'll be back soon!

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:09.640
Alright. All that's left now...

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:18.940
...is to fight!

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.820
Commence attack!

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:34.820
Riko...

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:39.830
I love you...
